        "text": "=🥊 New UFC event added\n\nEvent: {{ $('Classify UFC Events').item.json.event_name }}\n\nMain card time:\n{{ $('Classify UFC Events').item.json.event_datetime_local }}\n\nEvent key:\n{{ $('Classify UFC Events').item.json.event_key }}\n\nSource:\n{{ $('Classify UFC Events').item.json.source_url }}",
